&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forward Deployed Senior Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;(Migration Tooling – RunMyJobs)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR MISSION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Redwood, we empower our customers with lights-out automation for their mission-critical business processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT US&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Redwood Software is the leader in full-stack automation fabric solutions for mission-critical business processes. Our flagship SaaS platform, &lt;strong&gt;RunMyJobs (RMJ)&lt;/strong&gt;, is the first composable automation platform specifically built for ERP environments. We enable organizations to orchestrate, manage, and monitor workflows across applications, services, and infrastructure — in the cloud or on premises.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our global team of automation experts, engineers, and customer success professionals work together to deliver seamless automation transformations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CORE VALUES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;One Team. One Redwood&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make Your Own Weather&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Obsess over Customer Success&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work the Problem&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be Curious&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the Outcome&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respect Each Other&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR IMPACT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Forward Deployed Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; focused on &lt;strong&gt;migration tooling and customer onboarding to RunMyJobs (RMJ)&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp; This role is part of an&lt;strong&gt; exciting new Forward Deployed Engineering team &lt;/strong&gt;within the Global Professional Services team, at the intersection of &lt;strong&gt;Product Engineering and Go To Market&lt;/strong&gt; teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will operate at the intersection of engineering and delivery. Your primary focus will be designing, building, and enhancing &lt;strong&gt;migration frameworks, tooling, and automation accelerators&lt;/strong&gt; that enable customers to smoothly transition from legacy schedulers and automation platforms into RMJ.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work closely with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Migration Architects&lt;/strong&gt; to design scalable and reusable migration patterns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional Services&lt;/strong&gt; to enable efficient customer onboarding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering &amp;amp; Product&lt;/strong&gt; to improve platform capabilities based on field learnings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customers (occasionally)&lt;/strong&gt; to validate requirements, troubleshoot edge cases, and ensure successful implementations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a forward-deployed engineering role — highly technical, impact-driven, and closely aligned to real-world customer migration challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KEY RESPONSIBILITIES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Migration Tooling &amp;amp; Automation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and develop scalable &lt;strong&gt;migration tooling, scripts, and automation frameworks&lt;/strong&gt; to accelerate onboarding into RunMyJobs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reusable components to migrate workflows, jobs, dependencies, and configurations from legacy systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify migration bottlenecks and develop technical solutions to streamline data transformation and validation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to internal tooling that increases migration repeatability, reliability, and speed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forward Deployed Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Migration Architects to translate migration strategies into executable tooling and frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Professional Services during complex or high-impact migration engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot migration-related production issues and resolve edge cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Occasionally, engage directly with customer technical teams to understand source environments and validate solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform &amp;amp; Product Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide structured feedback to Product and Core Engineering teams to improve RMJ migration capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to architectural discussions, ensuring scalability, security, and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocate for automation best practices in enterprise migration scenarios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clean, maintainable, well-documented code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement automated testing (unit, integration, end-to-end).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to CI/CD improvements for migration tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor team members and contribute to a culture of continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR EXPERIENCE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering, or an equivalent combination of practical experience. Overall experience 8+ years.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong professional experience in Java (Java 11/17+)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AI-driven automation use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building backend services, APIs, and automation tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with XML and JSON types, libraries like Jackson, Lombok&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with relational databases (PostgreSQL, MySQL). Experience with scripting and automation (e.g., Shell scripting, Gradle).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with containerization (Docker), strong debugging and troubleshooting skills in complex environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with automated testing (JUnit, AssertJ, Mockito).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to collaborate cross-functionally across engineering, architects, and delivery teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AI-driven automation use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience migrating enterprise systems or schedulers to modern SaaS platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in automation, workload scheduling, or ERP environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SAP knowledge (ABAP, HANA).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with CI/CD pipelines (GitHub Actions, Jenkins, GitLab CI).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in customer-facing or forward-deployed engineering roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SUCCESS IN THIS ROLE LOOKS LIKE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reduced migration time and manual effort through reusable tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved reliability and predictability of RMJ onboarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration across Migration Architects and Professional Services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive identification of platform gaps and contribution to product evolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Successful onboarding of complex enterprise customers onto RunMyJobs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY JOIN US?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct impact on strategic customer onboarding and revenue acceleration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to shape migration frameworks for a category-leading automation platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in a collaborative, cross-functional environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation and comprehensive benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;“One Redwood” culture focused on ownership and customer success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;css-1i27f3a&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;css-ey7qxc&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;css-1s1axh3&quot; data-automation-id=&quot;jobPostingDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you like growth and working with happy, enthusiastic over-achievers, you&#39;ll enjoy your career with us!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
